    "intro_narrative": "The year is 2142, decades after the Great Collapse. You have stumbled into an underground survival bunker, rumored to hold the 'Genesis Stash'—a cache of purified seeds and clean water filtration blueprints that could restore the wasteland. The bunker is sealed tight, its systems locked behind a complex web of interconnected terminals, forgotten datapads, and jury-rigged machinery. Time is running out as the surface radiation storms grow stronger. You must navigate this desolate facility, tracing the flow of power and data between the decaying devices, to finally uncover the salvation hidden within.",
    "narrative_style": "post_apocalyptic"
  },
